:: Forest - kidnapper event [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />


<<set _kidnapped = $guests[$forestKidnapEvent]>>
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = 'Worker'>>

<center>
    <<image 'places/forest/forest_kidnapper.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

One of the other forest workers came back at dawn, breathing hard. Two men — not scavengers, too deliberate for that. They'd pulled <<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>> off the logging path while she was working alone at the far end of the site. It happened fast. She didn't have time to shout.
<br /><br />

<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    I couldn't do anything. There were two of them and they had knives. I'm sorry.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

They had maybe a six-hour head start. If you move now, you might still find the trail.
<br /><br />

<div id="fke_rescue">
<<link 'Go after them'>>
    <<goto 'Forest - kidnapper rescue'>>
<</link>>
</div>
<div id="fke_ignore">
<<linkreplace 'Leave it'>>
    <<run $('#fke_rescue').hide()>>
    <<if setup.percentageChance(35)>>
        <<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>> made it back on her own four days later. Exhausted, barely talking, but alive. Whatever happened in those four days she kept to herself.
        <br /><br />
        <<set _kidnapped.happy = Math.max((_kidnapped.happy ?? 0) - 30, -100)>>
        <<set _kidnapped.relationship = Math.max((_kidnapped.relationship ?? 0) - 25, -100)>>
        <<set _kidnapped.sick = {days: randomInteger(5, 10), desc: 'Exhausted and injured', id: 'exhaustion'}>>
        <<if _kidnapped.virgin>><<run setup.npc.addHistory(_kidnapped, 'virgin_lost')>><</if>>
        <<set _kidnapped.virgin = false>>
        <<set _kidnapped.sexStats ??= {}>>
        <<set _kidnapped.sexStats.pussy = (_kidnapped.sexStats.pussy ?? 0) + randomInteger(3, 8)>>
        <<set _kidnapped.sexStats.bj = (_kidnapped.sexStats.bj ?? 0) + randomInteger(2, 5)>>
        <<if setup.pregnancyChance(_kidnapped)>>
            <<set _kidnapped.pregnancy = 0>>
            <<set _kidnapped.pregnancy_father = 'unknown'>>
        <</if>>
        <strong>(<<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>>: Happy −30, Relationship −25, sick <<=_kidnapped.sick.days>> days)</strong>
    <<else>>
        <<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>> never came back.
        <<guestRemove $forestKidnapEvent>>
    <</if>>
    <<set $forestKidnapEvent = null>>
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Continue'>>
        <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
